<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<wxsmith>
	<object class="wxFrame" name="HelpFrame">
		<title>Special Keys</title>
		<pos_arg>1</pos_arg>
		<size_arg>1</size_arg>
		<handler function="OnClose" entry="EVT_CLOSE" />
		<object class="wxHtmlWindow" name="ID_HTMLWINDOW1" variable="HtmlWindow1" member="yes">
			<htmlcode>&lt;html&gt;&#x0A;&#x0A;&lt;style&gt;&#x0A;body {&#x0A;  font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Sans-Serif;&#x0A;}&#x0A;&#x0A;&lt;/style&gt;&#x0A;&#x0A;&lt;body&gt;&#x0A;&lt;div style=&quot;border:2px black solid; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; background-color:#FFFFBB&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\t&lt;b&gt;Special keys&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;Note that in most cases you can also use edit.tf escapes&lt;br/&gt;\\t\\tPage Up - Show next page of carousel&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tPage Down - Show previous page of carousel&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tF11 - Hide/Reveal&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-Z - Undo&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tESC-q - Show control codes (or Alt-Gr) &lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;                                      ESC-Ctrl-s - Insert second language toggle&#x0A;\\t&lt;/span&gt;&#x0A;&lt;/div&gt;&#x0A;&lt;div style=&quot;border:2px black solid; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;b&gt;Text colours&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F1 - Red text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F2 - Green text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F3 - Yellow text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F4 - Blue text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F5 - Magenta text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F6 - Cyan text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F7 - White text&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tShift-F8 - Black text (Level 2.5)&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;/span&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;b&gt;Graphic colours&lt;/b&gt;\\tWhen the small graphics cursor is displayed then pressing space will toggle the pixel on and off. Also, the keys q,w,a,s,z,x toggle individual bits within a mosaic character&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; background-color:#BBBBBB&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F1 - Graphics red&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F2 - Graphics green&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F3 - Graphics yellow&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F4 - Graphics blue&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F5 - Graphics magenta&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F6 - Graphics cyan&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F7 - Graphics white&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCtrl-F8 - Graphics black (Level 2.5)&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;/span&gt;&#x0A;&lt;/div&gt;&#x0A;&lt;div style=&quot;border:2px black solid; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;b&gt;Effects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; background-color:#BBBBBB&quot;&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-H - Flash&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-I - Steady&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-J - End Box&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-K - Start Box&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-L - Normal height&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-M (enter) - Double height&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-R - Conceal display&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-E - Contiguous graphics (esc s)&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-T - Separated graphics (esc S)&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-U - Black background&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-B - New background&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-W - Hold graphics&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t\\tCTRL-X - Release graphics&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;                               &lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;                               CTRL-BACKSPACE - Delete Row&lt;br/&gt;&#x0A;\\t&lt;/span&gt;&#x0A;&lt;/div&gt;&#x0A;&#x0A;&lt;/body&gt;&#x0A;&lt;/html&gt;</htmlcode>
			<pos>0,72</pos>
			<size>344,384</size>
		</object>
	</object>
</wxsmith>
